# What `clasp push` must never upload to the Apps Script project.
#
# .clasp.json has rootDir "" and skipSubdirectories false, so by default every
# .js/.gs/.html/.json under the repo is pushed -- including the static PWA
# bundle in www/, which would land browser code (document, localStorage, a
# top-level boot()) in the server's global scope and 500 every request.
#
# clasp replaces its built-in defaults once this file exists, so they are
# re-listed here rather than assumed.
**/node_modules/**
**/.git/**
.claude/**
.netlify/**
dev/**
www/**
assets/**
design_handoff_aura_key/**
netlify.toml
package.json
package-lock.json
